<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
  html { background: #ffffff; }
  body {
    width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
    background: #FFFFFF; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  }
  .header {
    background: #2C3E50; padding: 20pt 40pt;
    height: 40pt; display: flex; align-items: center;
  }
  h1 { color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 28pt; margin: 0; }
  .content { padding: 40pt; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; height: 100%; }

  .item {
    display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30pt;
    background: #FDFEFE; border: 1pt solid #D5D8DC; padding: 15pt;
    border-radius: 8pt; box-shadow: 2pt 2pt 5pt rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }
  .icon-box {
    width: 50pt; height: 50pt; background: #3498DB; color: white;
    border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 20pt; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .text-box h3 { margin: 0 0 5pt 0; color: #2C3E50; font-size: 20pt; }
  .text-box p { margin: 0; color: #7F8C8D; font-size: 16pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>第三篇：生活中的金融智慧</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="item">
      <div class="icon-box">1</div>
      <div class="text-box">
        <h3>个人资产管理</h3>
        <p>重视人力资本提升，充分利用社保与住房公积金。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="item">
      <div class="icon-box" style="background: #E67E22;">2</div>
      <div class="text-box">
        <h3>房产与信用</h3>
        <p>理解房贷的金融逻辑，像爱护眼睛一样维护个人信用评分。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="item">
      <div class="icon-box" style="background: #E74C3C;">3</div>
      <div class="text-box">
        <h3>风险防范</h3>
        <p>识别非法集资陷阱，科学配置保险，构建家庭安全防火墙。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>